# registri/toolset permukaan F3), plus sub-baris storage konsumen pola ADR-074 (ctxdb/planstore 220,
# ctxdb/importstore 200, ctxdb/usagestore 260). Sigma core 44.789 -> 46.385 <= 47.000.
# Kelas MODULE (ADR-196): modul permukaan F3 dengan cap SPEC §3.2.4, DI LUAR Sigma core seperti baris
# infra non-produksi (ADR-086 NEW-34), tetapi tetap dijaga per-baris oleh `scripts/loc-check.sh budget`
# dan `TestLocBudgetModuleRows`. Format: MODULE <grup> <LOC> <direktori...>; grup unik lintas semua
# baris, direktori internal/..., tidak boleh tumpang tindih dengan baris lain. F3 family
# importer+setup+doctor+update+profiles 7.300 + backup 1.467 = 8.767 <= 9.000 (SPEC §3.2.4);
# total F3 10.000 + 2.500 + 7.300 + 1.467 = 21.267 <= 21.500. TOTAL 190.000 tidak berubah.
# ADR-196: SPEC §3.2.4:283 (tui 10.000).
MODULE tui        10000 internal/tui
# ADR-196: SPEC §3.2.4:284 (acp 2.500).
MODULE acp         2500 internal/acp
# ADR-196: SPEC §3.2.4:285 family importer+setup/doctor/update/profiles (importer 2.600).
MODULE importer    2600 internal/importer
# ADR-196: SPEC §3.2.4:285 family importer+setup/doctor/update/profiles (setup 1.300).
MODULE setup       1300 internal/setup
# ADR-196: SPEC §3.2.4:285 family importer+setup/doctor/update/profiles (doctor 1.100).
MODULE doctor      1100 internal/doctor
# ADR-196: SPEC §3.2.4:285 family importer+setup/doctor/update/profiles (update 1.500).
MODULE update      1500 internal/update
# ADR-196: SPEC §3.2.4:285 family importer+setup/doctor/update/profiles (profiles 800).
MODULE profiles     800 internal/profiles
# ADR-244 (F4): kelas MODULE di luar Σ core, cap persis SPEC §3.2.4. SPEC `heal + obs` 5.500
# dipecah: baris core `heal` 1.500 (di atas) + MODULE obs 4.000 = 5.500. SPEC gateway 10.500 =
# MODULE gateway 9.600 + MODULE gwstore 900 (ADR-074; dibukukan ADR-245). `cron` 3.500.
# `scorecard` 500 dari baris SPEC `batch/evals/trajectory + scorecard job` 3.000; sisa 2.500
# tetap rencana F8. Σ MODULE F4 = 18.700; Σ kelas MODULE = 38.500 (+backup core 1.467 = 39.967)
# <= 40.000 (headroom 33; modul berikutnya butuh keputusan eksplisit, ADR-248).
# ADR-244: SPEC §3.2.4:282 (`heal`+`obs` 5.500 -> obs 4.000).
MODULE obs         4000 internal/obs
# ADR-244: SPEC §3.2.4:286 (gateway core + gateway/telegram 10.500 -> gateway 9.600).
# ADR-253 + ADR-254: total SPEC gateway 10.500 = gateway 9.500 + gwstore 1.000
# (parity C settings/home + emergency-stop replay; tidak ada perubahan SPEC).
MODULE gateway     9500 internal/gateway
# ADR-245: sisa SPEC gateway 10.500 = storage konsumen `ctxdb/gwstore` (ADR-074),
# dibukukan sebagai MODULE agar Σ core 47.511/47.600 tidak ditembus.
# ADR-253/254: 900 -> 1.000 (home channel, chat setting, replay window; terukur).
MODULE gwstore     1000 internal/ctxdb/gwstore
# ADR-244: SPEC §3.2.4:287 (cron 3.500).
MODULE cron        3500 internal/cron
# ADR-248: storage konsumen cron_jobs/cron_runs (ADR-074) dipotong dari baris SPEC cron 3.500
# tanpa DDL baru; 200 LOC.
MODULE cronstore     200 internal/ctxdb/cronstore
# ADR-244: SPEC §3.2.4:307 (scorecard job 500 dari 3.000; sisa 2.500 F8).
MODULE scorecard    500 internal/scorecard
# ADR-268 (F5-09 awal): SPEC §3.2.4:291 `mcp` (client + server + OAuth + pin
# tool) 6.500; kode fondasi seam terukur 79. Sigma kelas MODULE 38.500 ->
# 45.000 (+backup 1.467 = 46.467 <= 46.500; maxModuleLOC 40.000 -> 46.500).
# ADR-272 (F5-10): storage konsumen `ctxdb/mcpstore` (pin SEC-04, ADR-074)
# dibukukan di grup MODULE mcp yang sama; cap 6.500 tidak berubah.
# ADR-274 (F5-11a): seam OAuth MCP (TokenSource, bearer + refresh 401, scope minimal).
# F5-11c (SEC-21): server `mcp serve` + storage token/approval
# `ctxdb/mcpservestore`; kode terukur 2.206/6.500 (C2), cap tidak berubah.
MODULE mcp         6500 internal/mcp internal/ctxdb/mcpstore internal/ctxdb/mcpservestore
# ADR-273 (F5-12 PR B, GAP-TOOL-05): baris delegate untuk tipe/Config/Service
# (lease, worktree, limiter) + LeaseGuard codetools; SPEC §3.2.4:290. Kode
# terukur 453 (PR B) -> 959 (PR C); Sigma kelas MODULE 45.000 -> 47.000 (maxModuleLOC 46.500 -> 49.000).
# ADR-277 (F5 exec backends PR B): baris baru `MODULE backend` 4800 untuk
# internal/exec/backends (transport CLI bersama; terukur 223). Sigma MODULE
# 47.000 -> 51.800 (+backup 1.467 = 53.267 <= 53.800); core tetap.
MODULE backend     4800 internal/exec/backends
# ADR-294 (F5 codeintel slice 1): baris baru `MODULE codeintel` 7000 untuk
# internal/codeintel (SPEC §3.2.4:292; go/ast + repo map; terukur 366 pada
# slice 1). Sigma MODULE 51.800 -> 58.800 (+backup 1.467 = 60.267 <= 61.000).
MODULE codeintel   7000 internal/codeintel
MODULE delegate    2000 internal/delegate
